UPDATE public.repair_shops SET name_en = COALESCE(name_en, $en$Chalkak Isangja$en$), address_en = COALESCE(address_en, $en$2F, 23 Jaesong 1-ro, Haeundae-gu, Busan$en$), specialty_en = COALESCE(specialty_en, $en$Manual film cameras, rangefinders, lenses$en$), description_en = COALESCE(description_en, $en$In Jaesong-dong, Haeundae. Works mainly on manual film cameras. It publishes a list of the models it handles, including the Nikon F, FM, and FE, Canon A series and Canonet, Pentax SP, K, and M, Minolta X300 and SRT, Olympus PEN and Trip 35, and Yashica Electro, along with Ricoh, Mamiya, Konica, Fujica, Praktica, Contax, and Topcon. Services range from inspection and cleaning to full overhauls. Also does lens cleaning and aperture and focus calibration. Repair discounts for minor brands and manual models such as the Cosina CT-1, Cobica 35, Yashica FX-3, and Ricoh XR-5. The published model list and price list date from April 2021 and may have changed. Ask whether the repair is possible and what it costs before you go.$en$) WHERE name = '찰칵이상자' AND region = '부산';
